[Desktop Entry]
Type=Application
Name=Omnishell drawer
Name[fr]=Volet Omnishell
Comment=Opens the Gemini web app in a side drawer. Not affiliated with Google.
Comment[fr]=Ouvre l'application web Gemini dans un volet latéral. Non affilié à Google.
# Only the Shell extension starts the drawer (Meta.WaylandClient, panel.js): a copy started elsewhere would take
# the bus name and leave the Shell without its window. Launching this entry (gtk-launch, a click on one of the
# drawer's notifications) therefore asks the extension to toggle the drawer, as Super+G does (control.js).
Exec=/usr/bin/gdbus call --session --dest io.github.maximeallanic.OmnishellShell --object-path /io/github/maximeallanic/OmnishellShell --method io.github.maximeallanic.OmnishellShell.Toggle
Icon=omnishell-gemini-symbolic
NoDisplay=true
